{"abstract":"Mass protest movements for political change erupted in Iraq and Lebanon in October 2019. Today both countries stare into an abyss of bankruptcy, crumbling social services, poverty and the threat of renewed violence without any sign that political elites will take steps toward reforms. In this context, political violence has (again) taken center stage. Within a notion of ‘revolutionary impasse’, this article analyses the debate about recent assassinations of two prominent intellectuals in Iraq and Lebanon.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Haugbolle, Sune","Andersen, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-567082"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Iraq","Lebanon","Political violence"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"political assasinations and the revolutionary impasse in lebanon and iraq","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://merip.org/2021/05/political-assassinations-and-the-revolutionary-impasse-in-lebanon-and-iraq/","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-567082","ids":["ruc-a4c9d39b-fed0-420f-822b-2e20d64790cc"],"keyword":["Iraq","Lebanon","Political Violence"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-7465EACF03B3D68C0BDFCEEA025B443F"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Social Science (SOC)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of Social Sciences and Business","Roskilde University, Department of Social Sciences and Business, Global Political Sociology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Sune","key":"haugbollepau","last":"Haugbolle","locid":"c0eff4c5-4d77-4108-bd9b-aa0fd85851af","name":"Haugbolle, Sune","orcid":"0000-0003-0094-1989","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"65fd08d3-de64-4543-a8fb-d7e2ae6b1d5d","name":"Andersen, Henrik","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["08992851"],"journal":"Middle East Report","status":"p","title":"Middle East Report"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-a4c9d39b-fed0-420f-822b-2e20d64790cc"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Political Assasinations and the Revolutionary Impasse in Lebanon and Iraq","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-567082","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
